            "text": "theorem finalAngular_release_decay (d : TailData) (eta : ℝ) {y t : ℝ}\n    (hy : d.releaseStart ≤ y) (hyt : y ≤ t) :\n    finalAngular d (t, eta) ≤ finalAngular d (y, eta) *\n      Real.exp (-(1 / 2 + 3 * d.h / 4) * (t - y))"
